  "description": "After work, the reader’s greatest joy is enjoying something delicious to eat. One day, they receive an invitation to a place called the “Secret Club.” Expecting just a restaurant, the reader is surprised when a young man suddenly appears in their room. And on top of that, the man’s lower half is… far from ordinary…?\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/controlboy), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/controlboy), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12914453), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000071940), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250567)",
